'''

HELP_STATUS = '''\
Show how the current directory differs from the repository. This is
the quick check: only the names and the sizes of the files are
compared, the files are not read. Use 'vrfdir check' to verify the
checksums.

Every file which differs is printed on its own line after a letter
(a name with a newline is escaped, see 'vrfdir --help'):

  S  the size of the file has changed
  D  the file is deleted
  C  conflict, the name is not a regular file anymore
