older vrfdir). The files are not read, the output is what was stored
when they were added. A name with a newline is escaped, see 'vrfdir
--help'.

exit codes:
  0    the files were printed
  3    error, for example the repository is missing or cannot be
       read
  64   wrong command line
  130  interrupted
'''

HELP_EXPORT = '''\
Print the SHA-256 checksum and the name of every added file in the
format of sha256sum, sorted by the bytes of the name. The files are
not read, the output is what was stored when they were added. A name
with a newline is escaped like sha256sum does. With it the files can
